 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Supreme Curse Master"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "en": "I ! I'm the strongest forbidden spellcaster in history"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Ye Lin transmigrated into a world overrun by demons and monsters. On the day of his class transfer, he became an SSS-rank Forbidden Spellcaster—and was immediately met with ridicule. Why? Because casting forbidden spells costs lifespan, and most Forbidden Spellcasters die young. But only Ye Lin knows: with his immortal body, the profession’s fatal flaw means nothing to him. When Ye Lin casually unleashed hundreds of forbidden spells in a single move, everyone around him was terrified. “How many lives do you have?!” “You’re using forbidden spells like normal attacks?!”"
  },
